458739026103320\",\"cover\":\"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/86764ae9860154bf729993c92e6c92c9~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:600:0.heic?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1798296343&x-signature=h5Brixk1%2BPrXFZv8SW7U%2BVlU%2BIY%3D\",\"duration\":16033,\"title\":\"你疯了别惹他，他老婆比禁忌还凶万倍第四季\",\"video_desc\":\"叶秋携陆离入古城，本想去丹楼借点东西，却一路炸场，陆离豪掷神晶、救下天香体林思思，反手斩丹楼长老，逼楼主交出万年寒冰魄与丹主秘典，荒古界拓跋茵上门挑衅，被陆离当场斩灭。大道书院暗中布局，欲在天选前除掉二人，叶秋不再藏拙，集结丹楼、剑宗、万兽谷、大雪山、神盟，真龙一吼万兽臣服，星辰塔夺裂空传承，陆离更炼出七彩极道丹，全城震动，天选将启，叶秋放话，七日之内，大道书院改名，这一次，他要让诸天都记住他。\",\"series_id\":\"7692425329742203928\",\"episode\":true,\"vertical\":false,\"content_type\":1004,\"recommend_info\":\"{\\\"channel_id\\\":\\\"94349615599\\\",\\\"request_id\\\":\\\"2026102722454240EA0B23933B89B3ABE6\\\",\\\"rank\\\":\\\"1\\\"}\",\"recommend_group_id\":\"7692425329742203928\",\"play_cnt\":911241,\"book_exist\":false,\"copyright\":\"酷匠小说\",\"show_rec_text\":true,\"rec_text\":\"4419万热度\",\"score\":\"8.2\",\"use_video_model\":true,\"episode_cnt\":330,\"video_platform\":3,\"disable_play\":false,\"category_schema\":\"[{\\\"category_id\\\":7,\\\"name\\\":\\\"玄幻\\\",\\\"schema\\\":\\\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=7&categoryName=玄幻&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\\\"},{\\\"category_id\\\":739,\\\"name\\\":\\\"逆袭\\\",\\\"schema\\\":\\\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=739&categoryName=逆袭&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\\\"},{\\\"category_id\\\":21,\\\"name\\\":\\\"修真\\\",\\\"schema\\\":\\\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=21&categoryName=修真&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\\\"},{\\\"category_id\\\":599,\\\"name\\\":\\\"异界\\\",\\\"schema\\\":\\\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=599&categoryName=异界&genreType=130&gender=2&source=detail\\\"}]\",\"color_dominate\":\"#282018\",\"video_detail\":{\"series_id\":7692425329742203928,\"followed\":false,\"series_play_cnt\":911241,\"episode_right_text\":\"更新到第330集\",\"series_title\":\"你疯了别惹他，他老婆比禁忌还凶万倍第四季\",\"series_intro\":\"叶秋携陆离入古城，本想去丹楼借点东西，却一路炸场，陆离豪掷神晶、救下天香体林思思，反手斩丹楼长老，逼楼主交