109178997263384\",\"aigc_image_id\":null,\"book_type\":0,\"text\":\"\",\"placeholder\":\"\",\"content\":\"\"}}],\"skeleton\":{\"data\":\"<cc_material_0 data-type=\\\"img-list\\\" /><h1>叶秋觉醒，执刀横推中洲大陆</h1><p>《你疯了别惹他，他老婆比禁忌还凶万倍》高能热播，核心看点锁定男主叶秋的硬核逆袭之路。身负上古传承与珍贵龙血，他熬过无数磨难，淬炼出顶尖刀法，拒绝依附旁人威名。各方势力忌惮他的成长，频频设下死局围剿，可叶秋越战越勇，刀斩来犯之敌，步步踏碎敌人阴谋。纵然危机遍布整个中洲大陆，依旧挡不住他逆势崛起。冲突不断升级，既有热血酣畅的对战，也有重重反转。不憋屈、不拖沓，沉浸式感受少年强者杀伐征战，追漫体验直接拉满。<cc_material_1 data-type=\\\"tag_topic_mention\\\">#漫剧研究社</cc_material_1> <cc_material_2 data-type=\\\"tag_topic_mention\\\">#漫剧产粮节</cc_material_2> <cc_material_3 data-type=\\\"tag_topic_mention\\\">#就是这部让我爱上了漫剧</cc_material_3> <cc_material_4 data-type=\\\"tag_topic_mention\\\">#这漫剧给人一种特别踏实的感觉</cc_material_4></p><cc_material_5 data-type=\\\"series_card_id\\\" /><cc_material_6 data-type=\\\"series_card_id\\\" /><cc_material_7 data-type=\\\"series_card_id\\\" />\",\"type\":\"html\"}}","post_type":22,"book_card":[],"tags":[],"reply_cnt":1,"digg_cnt":10,"has_digg":false,"create_time":1789952318,"title":"叶秋觉醒，执刀横推中洲大陆","user_info":{"user_id":"2355605301377963","user_type":12,"user_name":"红果粉","user_avatar":"https://p3-novel.byteimg.com/img/novel-static/1437c63bc45b464bb1cc6cd6a7b0d4f1~tplv-1yzifmftcy-expand:200:0:0.png","is_author":false,"gender":2,"description":"大家想看什么可以关注我，我去给大家看完做一个总结，我去探路，","is_vip":false,"is_official_cert":false,"has_medal":false,"relation_type":1,"can_follow":true,"is_cancelled":false,"fans_schema":"dragon8662://webview?loadingButHideByFront=1&hideNavigationBar=1&bounceDisable=1&hideStatusBar=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Freading.snssdk.com%2Freading_offline%2fnovelread_community%2Fpage%2Fuser-social.html%3Ftab%3Dfans%26user_id%3D2355605301377963","follow_schema":"dragon8662://webview?loadingButHideByFront=1&hideNavigationBar=1&bounceDisable=1&hideStatusBar=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Freading.snssdk.com%2Freading_offline%2fnovelread_community%2Fpage%2Fuser-social.html%3Ftab%3Dfollow%26user_id%3D2355605301377963","encode_user_id":"#c1967_MTk2NzE5NjcxOTY3MTk2N1kiNxBigW2u2K8IMFNBULbddrjYRNuorbvDORlbim+t","ugc_read_book_count":0,"profile_gender":2,"user_sticker":{"sticker":null,"expire_time":0,"is_worn":false},"expand_user_avatar":"https://p3-novel.byteimg.com/img/novel-static/1437c63bc45b464bb1cc6cd6a7b0d4f1~tplv-1yzifmftcy-expand:200:0:0.png"},"ugc_privacy":0,"relative_type":0,"book_id":"0","pure_content":"叶秋觉醒，执刀横推中洲大陆 《你疯了别惹他，他老婆比禁忌还凶万倍》高能热播，核心看点锁定男主叶秋的硬核逆袭之路。身负上古传承与珍贵龙血，他熬过无数磨难，淬炼出顶尖刀法，拒绝依附旁人威名。各方势力忌惮他的成长，频频设下死局围剿，可叶秋越战越勇，刀斩来犯之敌，步步踏碎敌人阴谋。纵然危机遍布整个中洲大陆，依旧挡不住他逆势崛起。冲突不断升级，既有热血酣畅的对战，也有重重反转。不憋屈、不拖沓，沉浸式感受少年强者杀伐征战，追漫体验直接拉满。#漫剧研究社 #漫剧产粮节 #就是这部让我爱上了漫剧 #这漫剧给人一种特别踏实的感觉","status":1,"ContentType":0,"origin_type":3,"post_schema":"dragon8662://seriesVideoList?post_id=7687700262164775486&cell_id=7319809168590766142&post_type=22&title=%E5%8F%B6%E7%A7%8B%E8%A7%89%E9%86%92%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E5%88%80%E6%A8%AA%E6%8E%A8%E4%B8%AD%E6%B4%B2%E5%A4%A7%E9%99%86","favorite_cnt":1,"has_favorite":false,"can_favorite":false,"show_pv":0,"read_book_count":0,"related_topic_data":{},"video_list":[{"vid":"7664887844267101208","cover":"https://p3-reading-sign.fqnovelpic.com/novel-pic/525d20636cea7f89a2cb4376427b863b~tplv-81nmtwyey9-superreso-aifit:400:0.heic?lk3s=ae45642e&x-expires=1798296343&x-signature=KpzUPPOdRuntLYT1W8BTUoehPlg%3D","duration":7253,"title":"你疯了别惹他，他老婆比禁忌还凶万倍","video_desc":"叶秋，被父亲抛弃，母亲含冤惨死。十年后，体内上古大蛇苏醒，一口龙气让他从废柴暴涨为二十万斤气血的体修怪物。南州学府，他一拳打爆天王体弟弟，将叶江山夫妇踩入尘埃，揭穿母亲被害真相。中州大道城，他斩柳家嫡系、毙楚家天骄，连大道主雕像都主动为他显灵，亲选为传人。这一战，他要为母亲讨回所有公道，更要让整个中州记住——叶家弃子，终成诸天之主。","series_id":"7664886179241659454","episode":true,"vertical":false,"content_type":1004,"show_play_cnt":true,"play_cnt":1545811,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"酷匠小说","show_rec_text":true,"rec_text":"92961","score":"8.0","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":80,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":7,\"name\":\"玄幻\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=7&categoryName=玄幻&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":739,\"name\":\"逆袭\",\"schema\":\"dr